"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T22:55:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T22:55:51Z","body":"Rebased to resolve conflicts with DisplayServerEnum refactor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020196954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082677017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#issuecomment-4082677017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115666","id":4082677017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zWLUZ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T13:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T13:44:12Z","body":"Current usage of this signal looks something like this in most any use case I can think of:\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tget_window().hdr_output_changed.connect(_on_hdr_output_changed)\r\n\t_on_hdr_output_changed()\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _on_hdr_output_changed() -> void:\r\n\tvar output_max_linear_value = get_window().get_output_max_linear_value()\r\n\t...\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt might be nice to have the `output_max_linear_value` passed as an argument of the signal? This way the user doesn't need to retrieve it from the `Window` every time the signal is sent. Combined with a signal name change to `output_max_linear_value_changed`, this probably makes it more intuitive.\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar window: Window = get_window()\r\n\twindow.output_max_linear_value_changed.connect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n\t_on_output_max_linear_value_changed(window.get_output_max_linear_value())\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _on_output_max_linear_value_changed(output_max_linear_value: float) -> void:\r\n\t...\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082677017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4104467091","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#issuecomment-4104467091","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115666","id":4104467091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70pTKT","user":{"login":"DarkKilauea","id":1929107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjkxMDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1929107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkKilauea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T21:31:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T21:31:02Z","body":"> It might be nice to have the `output_max_linear_value` passed as an argument of the signal? This way the user doesn't need to retrieve it from the `Window` every time the signal is sent. Combined with a signal name change to `output_max_linear_value_changed`, this probably makes it more intuitive.\r\n> \r\n> ```gdscript\r\n> func _ready() -> void:\r\n> \tvar window: Window = get_window()\r\n> \twindow.output_max_linear_value_changed.connect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n> \t_on_output_max_linear_value_changed(window.get_output_max_linear_value())\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> func _on_output_max_linear_value_changed(output_max_linear_value: float) -> void:\r\n> \t...\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nDone! The signal will now emit the current value of `Window.output_max_linear_value`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4104467091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120882575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#issuecomment-4120882575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115666","id":4120882575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71n62P","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T19:38:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T19:38:37Z","body":"This is looking great to me! Scripts that used to be:\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\r\n\tvar output_max_linear_value = get_window().get_output_max_linear_value()\r\n\t# Do something with output_max_linear_value\r\n```\r\n\r\nCan now be written as:\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\tvar window: Window = get_window()\r\n\twindow.output_max_linear_value_changed.connect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n\t_on_output_max_linear_value_changed(window.get_output_max_linear_value())\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\r\n\tget_window().output_max_linear_value_changed.disconnect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _on_output_max_linear_value_changed(output_max_linear_value: float) -> void:\r\n\t# Do something with output_max_linear_value\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis seems like a good improvement to me.\r\n\r\nI'm adding this to the agenda for tomorrow's Core meeting so we can make sure the public API is appropriate before porting this to the other platforms.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120882575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4170745282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#issuecomment-4170745282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115666","id":4170745282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74mIXC","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T15:05:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T15:05:09Z","body":"I created a followup PR to this one that adds the events for Apple and Wayland: #118076","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4170745282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184255345","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#issuecomment-4184255345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115666","id":4184255345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75Zqtx","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:04Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184255345/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]